From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Max Leontev <max@localhost>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 14:56:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: sun50i-h6-orangepi-3: enable PWM0 on PD22

CON12 pin 7 is PD22 / hardware PWM0. Mux it via pinctrl function "pwm"
(H6 naming; channel 0) so sysfs pwmchip0/pwm0 drives the header pin.
PWM1 on PB19 stays claimed by ac200_pwm_clk for the onboard codec.

Signed-off-by: Max Leontev <max@localhost>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h6-orangepi-3.dts | 8 +++++++-
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h6-orangepi-3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-h6-orangepi-3.dts
@@ -218,9 +218,17 @@
 	vcc-pc-supply = <&reg_bldo2>;
 	vcc-pd-supply = <&reg_cldo1>;
 	vcc-pg-supply = <&reg_vcc_wifi_io>;
+
+	/* CON12-P07: hardware PWM0 for hobby servos / external loads */
+	pwm0_pin: pwm0-pin {
+		pins = "PD22";
+		function = "pwm";
+	};
 };
 
 &pwm {
+	pinctrl-names = "default";
+	pinctrl-0 = <&pwm0_pin>;
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
